* **Formation Water Salinity & Resistivity:** ${{ sw_params.salinity|int }}\text{ ppm NaCl equivalent}$, $R_w = {{ "%.3f"|format(sw_params.rw) }}\text{ }\Omega\cdot\text{m} \text{ @ } {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.temp) }}^\circ\text{C}$ (Arps temperature scaling).
* **Electrical Tortuosity, Cementation & Saturation Exponents:** $a = {{ sw_params.a }}$, $m = {{ sw_params.m }}$, $n = {{ sw_params.n }}$

$$S_w^n + R_w \cdot B \cdot Q_v \cdot S_w^{n-1} = \frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t} \quad \text{(Waxman-Smits Shaly-Sand)} \qquad S_w = \left(\frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t}\right)^{1/n} \quad \text{(Archie)}$$

